OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to buy theatre shop units
OL,4,Ato preserve facade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe retail units had been marketed
OL,7,Fseparately at #190,000. The council's
OL,8,Fpurchase will not include the theatre,
OL,9,Fwhich remains on the market at #1.1m.
